MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: IvanMegaphonePart2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Check every documentation discrepancy you see on this list.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Documentation Anomalies are an early sign that the mind is deteriorating.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Either that or the person is trying to pull a fast one on us.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Either way, maybe this person should be quarantined to stop any potential
      mutation early.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: If they have 5 or more symptoms they should be quarantined to bring
      their symptoms down.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: If they have 10 or more... Well, in that case they'd be too far gone,
      and need to be eliminated.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
